<title>ISRAEL: SOCCER-ISRAEL AND GREECE DRAW 1-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISRAEL AND GREECE DRAW 1-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel and Greece drew 1-1 (halftime 0-1) in an international soccer friendly on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Israel - Itzik Zohar 57</p>
<p>Greece - Christos Kostis 9</p>
</text>
